MISSION PAYMENT STRUCTURE - RATE CARD
Treasury office. Contract fees by tier. All in ryo. Front 40% / settle 60%.

Tier | Job type                          | Minimum fee   | Notes
-----|-----------------------------------|---------------|-----------------------
A    | Assassination, named target       |  15,000,000   | Body may be sold on
A    | Village-level sabotage            |  20,000,000   | Requires Leader approval
B    | Bodyguard / escort (criminal)     |   8,000,000   | Beneath most members
B    | Bounty hunting (opportunistic)    |   variable    | Per registered price
S    | Proxy war / large engagement      |  40,000,000+  | Cell-plus, Leader signs off

Rules: organisation takes no client who threatens the beast plan. Fees to treasury,
distributions at Kakuzu's discretion. Beast extractions are never contracted - they
are the mission, not for sale. - Treasury
